 "snippet": "    // L7 — THE MOAT. One gate, plugged. Crossing on foot costs everything.\n    make(\n      7,\n      [\n        king(5, 8), pawn(3, 7), bishop(1, 6), knight(2, 3), queen(2, 4),\n      ],\n      {\n        ...FLEE,\n        moveLimit: 10,\n        hazards: [X(1, 5), X(2, 5), X(4, 5), X(5, 5), X(6, 5), X(7, 5), X(8, 5), X(3, 4), X(3, 6), X(4, 8), X(7, 8), X(4, 6), X(7, 7), X(6, 6)],\n        kingPen: ['e7', 'f7', 'e8', 'f8'],\n      },\n    ),"
